  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Dragged into a warehouse by Furuya's gang, a battered Toshi is ordered to pay three hundred million yen. Kawada rushes in offering every yen he owns, and Toshi pays the final hundred million in blood to buy their freedom.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "言ってなかったか？俺は裏切られるのが何より嫌いなんだ。三億だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "三億なんて、あるわけねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "村西から奪ってこい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "待ってくださいよ！三億、私が払います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "五億だ。お前が払うなら五億だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "全資産合わせても四億がやっとです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ならあと一億だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さん、これで一億です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これで金輪際、俺たちには関わらないでください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "いいんじゃないか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ありがとな、川田。で、俺たちこっからどうすんだっけ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "働くしかないだろ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "言ってなかったか？俺は裏切られるのが何より嫌いなんだ。三億だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't I tell you? I hate being betrayed more than anything. Three hundred million.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "三億なんて、あるわけねえだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As if I could ever have three hundred million yen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "村西から奪ってこい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then go steal it from Muranishi.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "待ってくださいよ！三億、私が払います。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please wait! I will pay the three hundred million!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "五億だ。お前が払うなら五億だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Five hundred million. If you're the one paying, it's five hundred million.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "全資産合わせても四億がやっとです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even combining every asset I own, four hundred million is the absolute limit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "ならあと一億だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then that leaves one hundred million short.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さん、これで一億です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Furuya—let this cover the hundred million!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "これで金輪際、俺たちには関わらないでください！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With this, swear you will never have anything to do with us again!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "いいんじゃないか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fair enough, I suppose.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ありがとな、川田。で、俺たちこっからどうすんだっけ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thanks, Kawada. So—what are the two of us gonna do from here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "働くしかないだろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All we can do is work.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
